	(text "PS_CLK: Y701 33.333 MHz, 1.8 V CMOS (bank 500 = VCCO_MIO0 = 1.8 V) -> R701 33 R at Y701 -> ps_clk (U20 F7).\nCircuit of the Agilex 3 card's oscillator: EN tied to VDD, supply through FB701 with C701 470 n.\nLayout: Y701 close to F7, one point-to-point trace, R701 at the oscillator pin."
